[{"title":"香山示孔处厚","author":"晁冲之","text":"我来南经几山过，马行似冲山色破。\n风烟席卷嵓穴开，涧花萦回水流左。\n悬崖彷佛闻松声，下瞰幽深鸟飞堕。\n老夫他年有所归，定结白茅依紫逻。\n日高下马古寺门，鱼鼓欣闻脱清饿。\n道人碧眼照川谷，云起盘陀藉高坐。\n慇勤劝我更莫归，泪鹤啼猿亦相和。\n窗前笑唤祁孔宾，世间安用招魂些。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2989,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽十六叔父朝散 其一","author":"晁冲之","text":"惨淡鱼山路，公归膺获麟。\n车送逾千两，人哀备百身。\n伤心蒿里夜，挥泪竹林春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2990,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽蔡晋如","author":"晁冲之","text":"南部清笳咽，东门素旐飞。\n如何一老汉，不及二疏归。\n宇宙那复见，死生从此违。\n吾年未四十，已叹故人稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2991,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效古别昭德群从","author":"晁冲之","text":"千载一相逢，相见无浃旬。\n一生能几别，且复无此身。\n昔别尚可惜，此别重惜之。\n两髀跨鞍马，非复少壮时。\n他人怪康强，自觉筋力衰。\n所苦气如缕，所忧命如丝。\n死生亦大矣，而乃常别离。\n人生一月间，得笑无六七。\n朝为众狙喜，莫作枯鱼泣。\n已矣泉下人，优哉冢中骨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2992,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别江子之","author":"晁冲之","text":"尽室飘零去上都，试于溱洧卜幽居。\n不从刺史求彭泽，敢向君王乞镜湖。\n平日甚豪今潦倒，少年最乐晚崎岖。\n故人鼎贵甘相绝，别后君须寄一书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2993,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"积善堂","author":"晁说之","text":"我家得姓自卫史，文王之昭钟厥美。\n西京御史府大夫，父慈子忠不惜死。\n至今墓上无曲棘，颍川岁时虔庙祀。\n中原丧乱厌风尘，南渡不及渡辽水。\n晚惟道武揽英雄，辽东之晁同兴起。\n世封颍川刺济州，子孙婵媛冠剑伟。\n唐有贤良如汉初，名动集贤为学士。\n是时海内图书家，一晁未议张与李。\n忠实文华入本朝，三祖百孙同一体。\n中祖颍川袭远封，东祖西祖复于济。\n自从决策罢兵来，平进不厌百寮底。\n即今门户益衰微，揽古怀今情曷已。\n上恩坱圠播无垠，宿莽心存春藿靡。\n漳州有母行百龄，疏封钿服明光里。\n夫人眼力尚针缕，拜恩不易从稚齿。\n初惟夫人有子贤，曰此布濩敢不俾。\n何劳梦帝血面论，直以微诚动旒扆。\n华堂白发喜更新，即看青袍子高第。\n寿斝千场日未央，膝下曾玄扶且倚。\n中眷有孙不能鸣，东眷孙文刊烨炜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2994,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪效柳子厚","author":"晁冲之","text":"月落鸡声寒，晓色静茅屋。\n开门惊不知，夜雪压脩竹。\n槎牙生新冰，鳞甲刻溪谷。\n皛皛洲渚明，冽冽川原肃。\n孤蹲雀不动，沉酣客犹宿。\n呼童晨汲归，独漱寒泉玉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2995,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答韩君表","author":"晁冲之","text":"百年鄠杜家相近，人物凋零我独惊。\n但见少陵能继祖，不闻小陆可优兄。\n终朝诗赋遒仍郁，老去文章健更成。\n敢拟济河轻一战，隐然望已怯长城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2996,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢沈次律水枕","author":"晁冲之","text":"沈侯笔力鼎可扛，左手截取吴淞江。\n折流来此一尺枕，指麾巨鳄回涛泷。\n平生性不好长物，举以遗我嗟无双。\n呼儿快取蕲笛簟，扫除尘榻移当窗。\n随眠置我丘壑里，始信孙郎真枕水。\n我生不出长安城，四十二年尘涴耳。\n领君此枕何洒然，睡起醒心如一洗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2997,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简江子之求茶","author":"晁冲之","text":"政和密云不作团，小夸寸许苍龙蟠。\n金花绛囊如截玉，绿面仿佛松溪寒。\n人间此品那可得，三年闻有终未识。\n老夫于此百不忙，饱食但苦夏日长。\n北窗无风睡不解，齿颊苦涩思清凉。\n故人新除协律郎，交游多在白玉堂，拣牙斗夸皆饮尝。\n幸为传声李太府，烦渠折简买头纲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2998,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题鲁山温泉","author":"晁冲之","text":"平生耳熟闻骊山，梦寐不到临潼关。\n当年太液金井碧，温泉宛在关山间。\n忆昔君来必十月，骑玉花骢带风雪。\n太真独侍沐浴边，鲸甲龙鳞影清绝。\n五十年升平一迷，却驱万骑出关西。\n自为前朝同祸水，翻令后代异廉溪。\n君不见汝海之南鲁山左，亦有此泉名不播。\n征夫问路说汤头，可怜是亦陈惊坐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2999,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠张琪君章","author":"晁冲之","text":"春风颇清识，评议登草木。\n燕麦与菟葵，种种承标目。\n如何桃李姿，结根滞空谷。\n我将俎豆之，折泄恐不欲。\n君且为此情，吾亦未免俗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3000,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠僧法一墨","author":"晁冲之","text":"黄山之巅百尺松，虬枝偃盖连群峰。\n山神守护魑魅避，道人剪伐天为容。\n扪崖踸踔篝火远，绝壁晻霭凝烟浓。\n玄霜霏霏玉杵下，捕麋煮角当严冬。\n阴房风日不可到，律琯吹尽灰无踪。\n小书细字著名姓，黄金照耀图双龙。\n守臣再拜选进日，九关有诏开重重。\n老儒偶得实天幸，千金更买无由逢。\n上人澹泊何所好，工书草隶如飞蓬。\n苦来求我惜不得，一酬十载相过从。\n君不见玉堂词人紫垣客，拜赐舞蹈黄罗封。\n长安纸价犹未贵，江南江北山皆童。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3001,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"晁冲之","text":"叔子拟度骅骝前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3002,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见降羌感事","author":"晁咏之","text":"沙场尺箠致羌浑，玉陛朝趋雨露恩。\n自笑百年家凤阙，一生肠断国西门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3003,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木香花","author":"晁咏之","text":"朱帘高槛俯幽芳，露浥烟霏玉褪妆。\n月冷素娥偏有态，夜寒青女不禁香。\n从教春事年年晚，要使诗人日日狂。\n替取秋兰纫佩好，忍随风雨受凄凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3004,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏葛试官","author":"晁咏之","text":"没兴主司逢葛八，贤弟被黜兄荐发。\n细思堪惜又堪嫌，一壁有眼半壁瞎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3005,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初行山","author":"晁咏之","text":"霭霭初蒸云，落落欲坠石。\n山深多晚花，照水自红碧。\n渔艇入烟小，松竹凌烟直。\n西风漾碧波，扁舟恣崎侧。\n客从北方来，苦遭世俗迫。\n登临虽夙愿，山川多未识。\n浩荡涉寒流，跻攀并苍壁。\n扪萝窥鸟道，踏径穷人迹。\n清泉洗尘心，山鸟惯幽客。\n逸兴良未已，日下千崖赤。\n十载孙承公，好具登山屐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3006,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿星寺","author":"晁咏之","text":"石磴插青云，禅宫入渺冥。\n归云侵客座，流水乱松声。\n天近月逾白，竹多山更青。\n从来丘壑志，不独付孙登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3007,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杭州思归","author":"晁咏之","text":"丘壑情无尽，田园兴有馀。\n何当厌泽国，不奈忆君庐。\n庭户草应长，江山木已疏。\n何时整归棹，八月洞庭湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3008,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"晁咏之","text":"当时鸡犬皆霄汉，自是刘郎不得仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3009,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"晁贯之","text":"思与诸公论人物，试凭清议赋招魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3010,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十魔军","author":"晁迥","text":"与道弥新世转疏，老心恢廓学如初。\n妄缘纷扰随时过，云物何曾碍碧虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3011,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"心祷六符诗","author":"晁迥","text":"恬和端洁及虚明，六妙均融道法成。\n愿考此祥皆密契，不求知己浪传名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3012,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自警","author":"晁迥","text":"清澄寂灭海，明净涅槃天。\n到此方知乐，休耽浊睡眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3013,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟古人诗","author":"晁迥","text":"今人学宴坐，不免寻思过。\n欲免寻思过，但知学宴坐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3014,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天诗","author":"晁迥","text":"自学养恬休用智，从他名迹日衰微。\n我身不欲全高贵，高贵多乘祸败机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3015,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天诗","author":"晁迥","text":"心不择时息，书不择时观。\n达理意无碍，豁如天地宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3016,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天期李二十文略王十八质夫不至独宿仙游寺","author":"晁迥","text":"角胜劳生不足云，滥传僧语亦非真。\n始知解爱禅中乐，万万人中无一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3017,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟庞居士诗","author":"晁迥","text":"人爱贵而富，我爱白而虚。\n富贵荣辱会，虚白吉祥居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3018,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"具足观修诀","author":"晁迥","text":"三空一不空，悟入势孤雄。\n得道加殊称，超天自在公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3019,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"晁迥","text":"宜城徵美酝，汉水得佳鲂。\n登岘思前哲，游池醉夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3020,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"晁迥","text":"貌愚愚谷邃，道醉醉乡春。\n愚醉无迷谬，伊予意又新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3021,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"造化因心偈","author":"晁迥","text":"赋象各由心，影响无欺诈。\n元无造化工，群生自造化。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3022,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚年勤道自修诗","author":"晁迥","text":"老来何故惜分阴，如月明亏魄渐侵。\n进道不遑求广智，随时随处且冥心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3023,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"意不求如 其二","author":"晁迥","text":"风花荣落速，水月净明深。\n物物观天理，资吾入道心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3024,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"意不求如 其一","author":"晁迥","text":"牢收长物金三品，密写虚名墨一行。\n失道信缘成苦趣，懵然流转海茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3025,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天遣怀","author":"晁迥","text":"羲和走驭趁年华，不许人间岁月赊。\n春正艳阳春即老，日方停午日还斜。\n时情莫测深如海，世事难齐乱似麻。\n已共身心要约定，古今如此勿惊嗟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3026,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天题赠定光上人","author":"晁迥","text":"孟子四十心不动，定光四十心离尘。\n我到明年加一倍，如何此际尚因循。\n已喜自逃名宦网，犹患长随造化钧。\n记得前贤有诗句，祖师元是世间人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3027,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送何水部蒙出牧袁州","author":"晁迥","text":"条教属惟良，乘秋始办装。\n朱轓重按部，白首尚为郎。\n督课民期富，从儒道益光。\n更资谈博物，千载楚萍乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3028,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"假山","author":"晁迥","text":"覆篑由心匠，多奇势逼真。\n盆池幽閒古，拳石翠峰新。\n云淡炉烟合，松滋树影邻。\n不须同谢傅，对此已精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3029,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游虎丘诗","author":"晁迥","text":"饯别阊门复少留，故人邀我浣离愁。\n旋沽美酝乘渔艇，急棹斜阳到虎丘。\n千古剑池呀怪石，一方金地枕清流。\n归时眷恋情无限，不得从容秉烛游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3030,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"静深生四妙辞","author":"晁迥","text":"了知入道门，先从静为祖。\n静胜则心安，安久虚灵府。\n虚极发明灵，洞彻无不睹。\n天然法乐多，岂比闻箫鼓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3031,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"属疾","author":"晁迥","text":"精鹜成勤瘁，颐贞俟有瘳。\n吟生南越思，慈结北堂忧。\n粲枕甘为蝶，丰厨厌炙牛。\n玄元知寡欲，平子尚多愁。\n夕鸟侵阶啄，宵萤入树流。\n玉书能静览，柱史倦闲投。\n忽赋行云什，堪听击壤讴。\n期君整朝佩，仙置在瀛洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3032,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三法自然歌","author":"晁迥","text":"心本不愆自然戒，何用科条防毁败。\n心本不动自然定，何用勤劳止自竞。\n心本不迷自然慧，何用参寻叩伦类。\n即今知此三自然，奉以周旋无失坠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3033,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三悟辞","author":"晁迥","text":"若能觉其梦，且悟浮生如戏弄。\n若能智其识，渐悟狂知枉心力。\n若能性其情，大悟归真即妙明。\n喜得自然三悟法，书之聊以表研精。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3034,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与道相知最乐篇","author":"晁迥","text":"人多乐于新相知，又多悲于生别离。\n唯能与道相知久，如鱼乐水无暌时。\n乐道至乐非常乐，宜真造适潜熙怡。\n逌然在心不在境，安能更与白云期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3035,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书绅二法辞","author":"晁迥","text":"心如常满杯，所以明知足。\n心似不燃火，所以明无欲。\n二法可行持，书绅聊自勖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3036,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双喻辞","author":"晁迥","text":"人事常酌中，取象如敧器。\n器平不敧覆，有同身爽利。\n道心常不系，取象如虚舟。\n舟閒随逝止，可比性优游。\n能符双喻者，何虑复何忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3037,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"反本观空无碍辞","author":"晁迥","text":"形是幻，情是梦，寝兴视息随群动。\n当念元来一切无，豁然顿遣心中空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3038,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无有所求歌","author":"晁迥","text":"无所求，摆落人间万事休。\n有所求，安养衰年乐圣猷。\n不愿竹木林内隐，不愿莲花社里收。\n愿在清平仁寿域，含华守素得优游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3039,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仿归去来辞","author":"晁迥","text":"陶令曾言归去来，解印还家不回首。\n屏贵都遗身外名，忘忧酷嗜杯中酒。\n白傅曾言归去来，了知浮世非长久。\n独步逍遥自得场，饮食寝兴随所偶。\n罗隐曾言归去来，濩落生涯何所有。\n明日船中竹一竿，要学江湖钓鱼手。\n晁叟亦言归去来，抗表辞荣养衰朽。\n京洛红尘旧满衣，总脱临风都抖擞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3040,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有警辞","author":"晁迥","text":"图上华夷能尽记，未始经行一步地。\n博闻强识总周知，心不能行亦如是。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3041,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自晓存心诀","author":"晁迥","text":"心息音，混融深。\n智先觉，念无侵。\n随办及，即漫寻。\n用此法，存于心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3042,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坚凝","author":"晁迥","text":"了知起灭意，决定生死根。\n不复随缘转，是名不动尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3043,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天诗 其二","author":"晁迥","text":"顺逆不由己，喜怒不由他。\n他即无奈何，己可存太和。\n且务由己者，克己谅诽多。\n勿贵由他者，他心是我魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3044,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天诗","author":"晁迥","text":"权要亦有苦，苦在当忧责。\n闲慢亦有乐，乐在无萦迫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3045,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天诗 其一","author":"晁迥","text":"求位不由己，求道不由天。\n位即无以求，道可使进焉。\n且务由己者，己能尽心源。\n勿问由天者，天高擅化权。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3046,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟白乐天诗","author":"晁迥","text":"多图果何益，只自劳奔竞。\n不如收身心，凝然成静定。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3047,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"知常委顺辞","author":"晁迥","text":"纷然往事来，浮云经大空。\n喧然是非声，惊飙触灌丛。\n古今无奈何，魏顺于其中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3048,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞心情境定心篇","author":"晁迥","text":"物来诱之而不随，物来触之而不动。\n不随不动自由心，何须结社询千众。\n万事悠悠过即空，追思岂异春宵梦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3049,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清风十韵","author":"晁迥","text":"仙御来相慰，解颜良会稀。\n病蠲宜养素，趣远欲忘机。\n惩躁能无渐，延龄或可祈。\n影摇珠箔细，声泛细筝微。\n委恨馀班扇，流欢入楚衣。\n陶潜知梦稳，韩寿畏香飞。\n气爽苍龙阙，凉生白虎闱。\n健资鸡距笔，偷撼兽镮扉。\n松下琴心逸，江东鲙缕肥。\n宿怀真隐处，终约与同归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3050,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"智断身心辞","author":"晁迥","text":"咨咨尔幻身，谁能住世久。\n洪纤妍愧，岂长存而不朽。\n咨咨尔幻心，常随外物诱。\n风生电灭，求其状而何有。\n豁然达理，忽洞见于天真。\n未能无闷，或沃之以圣酒。\n去乡游荡久不归，今觉穷途自回首。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3051,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"超真独觉辞","author":"晁迥","text":"了达事终虚，往事何殊梦。\n此后事来干，屹如山不动。\n了达事终虚，往事今何在。\n此后事来干，豁若空虚碍。\n独觉贵高奇，杰出群迷外。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3052,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句书绅自用辞","author":"晁迥","text":"蒙以正，德而隐。\n专于静，遁于遁。\n无是无非无所求，无名无迹无诸闷。\n愚自书绅用此言，深心更与何人论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3053,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"静中好","author":"晁迥","text":"静中好，冥心归宴寂。\n斋己不虚吟，静是真消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3054,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醒默居士歌","author":"晁迥","text":"白氏先生耽醉吟，衔杯洒翰恣欢心。\n樽空才尽若为计，释闷遣怀功未深。\n愚称居士名醒默，清思忘言求妙德。\n习此功成道更高，不到诗魔兼酒惑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":3055,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]